## AXIOM-SPECIFIC VALIDATION

### AX-1: Immutability
- **Definition**: No global mutable state outside Synchronized<T> ✓
- **Enforcement**: Clang-Tidy + ThreadSanitizer ✓
- **Violations**: 5 checkboxes (mutable globals, static locals, singletons, shared state, RuntimeParameters) ✓
- **Tests**: Compile-time assertion, Clang-Tidy config, TSan validation, manual review checklist ✓
- **Acceptance**: TSan clean (0 data races) + Clang-Tidy clean ✓

### AX-2: Determinism
- **Definition**: Identical inputs produce bitwise-identical outputs ✓
- **Enforcement**: Integer-only arithmetic, ordered containers, fixed seeds ✓
- **Violations**: 5 checkboxes (unordered containers, floating-point, random_device, chrono, manifest SHA256) ✓
- **Tests**: 100 builds determinism proof, static analysis script, regression tests ✓
- **Acceptance**: 100 builds identical + 0 static violations + all tests pass ✓

### AX-3: Atomic Failure
- **Definition**: All operations fail atomically (no partial state) ✓
- **Enforcement**: RAII ensures rollback, build stops on error ✓
- **Violations**: 5 checkboxes (RAII usage, error propagation, build atomicity, transactions, exception safety) ✓
- **Tests**: Exception safety tests, build atomicity test, transaction rollback test ✓
- **Acceptance**: All exception tests pass + build fails on error + 0 partial state ✓

### AX-4: No External State
- **Definition**: Pure functions (output determined by input only) ✓
- **Enforcement**: No file I/O, no network calls, no global mutation ✓
- **Violations**: 5 checkboxes (file I/O, network calls, global mutation, reproducibility, side effects) ✓
- **Tests**: Reproducibility test, external state isolation test, static analysis ✓
- **Acceptance**: Reproducibility tests pass + no mutations + static clean ✓

### AX-5: RAII
- **Definition**: All resources managed via constructor/destructor ✓
- **Enforcement**: Smart pointers, RAII wrappers, scoped locks ✓
- **Violations**: 6 checkboxes (new/delete, malloc/free, raw pointers, mutexes, Valgrind, ASan) ✓
- **Tests**: Valgrind test, ASan test, static analysis, exception leak test ✓
- **Acceptance**: Valgrind clean (0 leaks) + ASan clean + static clean ✓

### AX-6: Backward Compatibility
- **Definition**: No breaking changes, support N-2 versions (9 releases) ✓
- **Enforcement**: Additive API changes, versioned serialization, deprecation ✓
- **Violations**: 6 checkboxes (API compat, serialization, enums, structs, regression, version support) ✓
- **Tests**: Compatibility matrix (9×6=54 tests), ABI checker, round-trip test, version handler test ✓
- **Acceptance**: 54 compatibility tests pass + ABI clean + 0 regressions ✓

